Stage 5 S5-07 — current-source automatic counted N=2 retry
Date: 2026-11-15

Purpose and build
=================
Re-evaluate S5-07 after the narrow comparator normalization for the observed
init/nonce printk ordering and audit initialization timestamp, then execute a
fresh automatic counted N=2 series on the current runner.

The release runner was built offline from clean source revision
`61d6a6590e28a5619637bf70515335eafe48e2e1` on macOS/aarch64. Both run
manifests record `source_dirty=false`. The older `comparison.json` for the
2026-11-15 automatic series was generated before these comparator changes and
is historical evidence, not the result of the current comparator.

