Conclusion
==========
The current comparator explains the previously observed valid-marker pair, but
a fresh current-source run still failed because the guest nonce line was
interleaved with a kernel printk in COM1. Preserve strict marker validation.
S5-07 remains blocked/unaccepted until the output interleaving is localized or
otherwise prevented with evidence and a fresh automatic counted series passes.
